'''Crabominable ex''' (Japanese: '''ケケンカニex''' ''Kekenkani ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

